      "title": "30B Token Mixture Strategy",
      "dot": "cyan",
      "items": [
        "Curated for Chinchilla-optimal pretraining of the 1.13B-stored parameter model",
        "60% FineWeb-Edu for high-grade syntactic reasoning and factual density",
        "20% The Stack v2 (Python) and 20% Math/ArXiv for structural logic"
      ]
